// Zeta-owned Windows resource for the vendored TermIDE binary (`zetaide`).
// The upstream tree has no PE icon; this is a Zeta packaging deviation recorded
// in termide/VENDOR.md. The canonical icon is
// ../../../main/crates/zetawork-gui/assets/icon.ico; build.rs inlines it as an
// absolute path because older windres resolves ICON paths against the CWD.
1 ICON "@ZETA_ICON@"
